<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover"><meta name="theme-color" content="#F5F1E8"><title>Emma — AI Care Companion</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css"></head>
<body><main class="shell"><header class="topbar"><div><div class="eyebrow">EMMA</div><h1 id="greeting">Your care companion</h1></div><button class="ghost" id="resetBtn">Reset</button></header>
<details style="margin:0 0 16px;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:16px;background:#fff;font-size:14px">
<summary id="creditCounter" style="cursor:pointer">Estimated credit remaining: set balance</summary>
<p id="creditNote"></p>
<button class="ghost" id="setCreditBalance">Set current balance</button>
<a href="https://platform.openai.com/settings/organization/billing/overview" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open OpenAI billing</a>
<p>Testing only · USD · Rates checked September 15, 2026 · <a href="https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/pricing" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Pricing reference</a>. Set the balance between sessions after checking billing. Tracks future reported voice and transcription usage; cannot recover earlier costs. Use one Emma tab for testing.</p>
</details>
<section class="hero card"><div class="orb-wrap"><button id="talkBtn" class="orb" aria-label="Talk to Emma"><span class="orb-core"></span></button></div><h2 id="voiceState">Talk to Emma</h2><p id="voiceHint">Tap once, then speak normally.</p><div class="row"><button id="talkToggle" class="primary">Start conversation</button><button id="typeToggle" class="secondary">Type instead</button></div><div id="typeBox" class="type-box hidden"><input id="textInput" placeholder="Tell Emma what's happening…"><button id="sendText" class="primary small">Send</button></div><audio id="remoteAudio" autoplay></audio></section>
<section class="grid"><article class="card"><div class="section-head"><h3>Today</h3><span class="pill" id="eventCount">0 events</span></div><div id="todaySummary" class="summary">Nothing logged yet.</div></article><article class="card"><div class="section-head"><h3>Open loops</h3><span class="pill" id="loopCount">0</span></div><div id="loops" class="list muted">Nothing waiting.</div></article></section>
<nav class="tabs"><button class="tab active" data-tab="journey">Journey</button><button class="tab" data-tab="memory">Memory</button><button class="tab" data-tab="debug">Debug</button></nav>
<section id="journeyPanel" class="panel card"><div class="section-head"><h3>Journey</h3><span class="muted">Newest first</span></div><div id="journey" class="timeline"></div></section>
<section id="memoryPanel" class="panel card hidden"><div class="section-head"><h3>What Emma knows</h3><span class="muted">Stored on this device</span></div><div id="memory" class="memory-grid"></div></section>
<section id="debugPanel" class="panel card hidden"><div class="section-head"><h3>Developer debug</h3><span class="muted">Prototype only</span></div><pre id="debug"></pre></section><footer>Prototype only. Do not use for urgent or clinical decision-making.</footer></main><script type="module" src="/app.js"></script></body></html>